graph [
   directed 1
   citation "['M. W. Schein and M. H. Fohrman. &quot;Social dominance relationships in a herd of dairy cattle.&quot; The British J. of Animal Behaviour 3(2), 45-55 (1955), http://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0950560155800123']"
   description "Dominance interactions among a group of dairy cattle at the Iberia Livestock Experiment Station in Jenerette, Louisiana. Edge weights represent the frequency of interaction. The two versions below are equivalent."
   konect_meta "category: Animal &NewLine;code: MA&NewLine;name: Cattle&NewLine;description: Cattle–cattle dominances&NewLine;entity-names: cattle&NewLine;extr: moreno&NewLine;url: http://moreno.ss.uci.edu/data.html#cattle&NewLine;long-description: This directed network describes the dominance behavior observed between dairy cattle (<I>Bos taurus</I>) at the Iberia Livestock Experiment Station in Jenerette, Louisiana, USA.  A node represents a cow and an edge represents the dominance of the left cow over the right cow.  The edge weights indicate how often this <I>besting</I> behavior was observed.&NewLine;relationship-names: dominance&NewLine;cite: konect:schein&NewLine;tags:  #skew&NewLine;timeiso:  1955&NewLine;"
   konect_readme "Cattle network, part of the Koblenz Network Collection&NewLine;===========================================================================&NewLine;&NewLine;This directory contains the TSV and related files of the moreno_cattle network: This directed network describes the dominance behavior observed between dairy cattle (<I>Bos taurus</I>) at the Iberia Livestock Experiment Station in Jenerette, Louisiana, USA.  A node represents a cow and an edge represents the dominance of the left cow over the right cow.  The edge weights indicate how often this <I>besting</I> behavior was observed.&NewLine;&NewLine;&NewLine;More information about the network is provided here: &NewLine;http://konect.cc/networks/moreno_cattle&NewLine;&NewLine;Files: &NewLine;    meta.moreno_cattle -- Metadata about the network &NewLine;    out.moreno_cattle -- The adjacency matrix of the network in whitespace-separated values format, with one edge per line&NewLine;      The meaning of the columns in out.moreno_cattle are: &NewLine;        First column: ID of from node &NewLine;        Second column: ID of to node&NewLine;        Third column (if present): weight or multiplicity of edge&NewLine;        Fourth column (if present):  timestamp of edges Unix time&NewLine;        Third column: edge weight&NewLine;&NewLine;&NewLine;Use the following References for citation:&NewLine;&NewLine;@MISC{konect:2017:moreno_cattle,&NewLine;    title = {Cattle network dataset -- {KONECT}},&NewLine;    month = oct,&NewLine;    year = {2017},&NewLine;    url = {http://konect.cc/networks/moreno_cattle}&NewLine;}&NewLine;&NewLine;@article{konect:schein,&NewLine;	title = {Social Dominance Relationships in a Herd of Dairy Cattle},&NewLine;	author = {Schein, Martin W. and Fohrman, Milton H.},&NewLine;	journal = {The Br. J. of Anim. Behav.},&NewLine;	volume = {3},&NewLine;	number = {2},&NewLine;	pages = {45--55},&NewLine;	year = {1955},&NewLine;}&NewLine;&NewLine;@article{konect:schein,&NewLine;	title = {Social Dominance Relationships in a Herd of Dairy Cattle},&NewLine;	author = {Schein, Martin W. and Fohrman, Milton H.},&NewLine;	journal = {The Br. J. of Anim. Behav.},&NewLine;	volume = {3},&NewLine;	number = {2},&NewLine;	pages = {45--55},&NewLine;	year = {1955},&NewLine;}&NewLine;&NewLine;&NewLine;@inproceedings{konect,&NewLine;	title = {{KONECT} -- {The} {Koblenz} {Network} {Collection}},&NewLine;	author = {Jérôme Kunegis},&NewLine;	year = {2013},&NewLine;	booktitle = {Proc. Int. Conf. on World Wide Web Companion},&NewLine;	pages = {1343--1350},&NewLine;	url = {http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2488173},&NewLine;	url_presentation = {https://www.slideshare.net/kunegis/presentationwow},&NewLine;	url_web = {http://konect.cc/},&NewLine;	url_citations = {https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=7174338004474749050},&NewLine;}&NewLine;&NewLine;@inproceedings{konect,&NewLine;	title = {{KONECT} -- {The} {Koblenz} {Network} {Collection}},&NewLine;	author = {Jérôme Kunegis},&NewLine;	year = {2013},&NewLine;	booktitle = {Proc. Int. Conf. on World Wide Web Companion},&NewLine;	pages = {1343--1350},&NewLine;	url = {http://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=2488173},&NewLine;	url_presentation = {https://www.slideshare.net/kunegis/presentationwow},&NewLine;	url_web = {http://konect.cc/},&NewLine;	url_citations = {https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=7174338004474749050},&NewLine;}&NewLine;&NewLine;&NewLine;"
